{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0363_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1611ca33685cb07a0af0a20bd25d9cbfbc6f8458617473c838135aff022fe8d1", "ja": "（もうすぐ『近未来アウトサイダー』の撮影が始まる。\nみんな、稽古は進んでるかな……ん？）", "zh": "（《近未来局外人》的拍摄马上就要开始了。大家的排练进行得还顺利吗……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0363_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "d2fc29430cb8bc1a400a36028e67b2069727ff0eb45d7aa26cfc324d90057bfb", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\nちょっと、いい……？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n那个，方便吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0363_1002_p", "source_sha256": "44aee973017631c1d96dd90411eb717821521506f790fd6b70afe4d89d38e613", "ja": "どうしたんだ、杏奈。\n稽古で何かあったのか？", "zh": "怎么了，杏奈。\n排练时发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0363_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "dc4d7e11cb8a4bc45ed86ded3e69263815e4e62058299caa5784237cbeecbc0d", "ja": "ん……。みんな、役になりきってて、すごい……。\n杏奈、もっと……がんばらないと……。", "zh": "唔……大家都完全融入角色了，好厉害……\n杏奈也要……更加努力才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0363_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "83d8294caee6e25c4b6ef5587644ac491e57e699305466e4f29936bf0a5b420c", "ja": "だから、杏奈……{$P$}さんの、\nお世話がしたい……です。いい……？", "zh": "所以，杏奈……想照顾{$P$}先生……可以吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0363_1005_p", "source_sha256": "d6159b54b2c7aa6371d3f2516e51a6b1ac756263f2d259ba27998ea20303eec8", "ja": "お世話？　具体的にはどんな……。", "zh": "照顾？具体来说，是要怎么照顾……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0363_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "601be98b82f6b38377a21b9186561e2698362207a16b57619005042160b66a71", "ja": "アイビーは、アマリリス様の……\n身の回りのお世話、任されてる……だから……。", "zh": "常春藤，负责照料……\n阿玛丽莉丝大人……的日常起居……所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0363_1007_p", "source_sha256": "5875e894d4a25c60c185db4a77c95fbe8300ba521d39d103a1f1d1ee37645476", "ja": "身の回りのお世話か……それくらいならいいか。\nけど、杏奈の負担にならない範囲で頼むな。", "zh": "照顾日常起居吗……只是这样的话倒是没问题。不过，别让杏奈感到负担，量力而行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0363_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "39bf8bc52a6f96316c97070cc55d40d8e3e92829d96f143ddb93f642642581d8", "ja": "{$P$}さん、ありがとう……♪\nえっと……じゃあ……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，谢谢你……♪\n那个……那么……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0363_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "72c8e85f4f5667c6331f2849491c3e850d7c72e06956ef4623d3a654aea9f5bb", "ja": "……お世話って、何、すればいいのかな……。\n{$P$}さん……何、してほしい……？", "zh": "……照顾的话，要做些什么才好呢……？\n{$P$}先生……想让我做什么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0363_1010_p", "source_sha256": "f5397e870ece3111c1c4bd0376aeed9f8def2a8ce946c9524f1224c4a2b81c2f", "ja": "うーん。\n今してほしい事は、特にないけど……。", "zh": "嗯——\n现在没什么特别想让你做的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0363_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "114dd1e0a05edefa9cc36e939002ccee9232ec8eae92c1fbd25a0912257b8450", "ja": "そっか……あ、{$P$}さん。\nネクタイ、曲がってる……。", "zh": "这样啊……啊，{$P$}先生。\n领带歪了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0363_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "99684425fd1ab70d87d9b4495e9d316e9755e72e3a8799e71e7fccb773b19663", "ja": "杏奈に、任せて……。\nんっと……直すから……屈んで……？", "zh": "交给杏奈……  \n嗯……我帮你整理……弯下腰……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0363_1013_p", "source_sha256": "561507556fecdf797166ba4929c319a24418894fa15b8de387dccd66c4f4a989", "ja": "こうか？", "zh": "这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0363_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "221ce570e0d67eabf216042719421a7f77f4fed976ea9b77d92e4227eaf2b039", "ja": "ん……ありがと……。\nこれならちゃんと、杏奈の手……届く……。", "zh": "嗯……谢谢……。\n这样的话，杏奈的手……就能碰到了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0363_1015_024ann", "source_sha256": "516b356fc22ab7d2314aada9ecb01051142de61df25d9393a330b2f30a8124d4", "ja": "あ……{$P$}さん、顔が近い……。\nなんか……ちょっと、不思議な感じ……。", "zh": "啊……{$P$}先生，脸靠得好近……。\n总觉得……有点不可思议……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0363_1016_024ann", "source_sha256": "fb3af4c278d40ebb4a203a0b22001b1ede69ecd193c5889d8bfdd47f9b84c08d", "ja": "ん、できた……。\n杏奈、お世話係、できてる……？", "zh": "嗯，弄好了……杏奈有做好照顾人的工作吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0363_1017_p", "source_sha256": "2f62a280b7b1335cf7499aea00261090445cc975422469705aac1c0641c0296e", "ja": "ああ、ありがとう。うん、身だしなみを\n整えるのも、立派なお世話係の仕事だと思うぞ！", "zh": "啊，谢谢。嗯，我觉得整理仪容也是一名出色照料员的工作！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0363_1018_024ann", "source_sha256": "9c74197f22751462182c384fbc140b96b14f108ee10a7e1036fa681463b623df", "ja": "ん、よかった……♪　{$P$}さん……\n今日は杏奈が、いっぱいお世話する……よ……！", "zh": "嗯，太好了……♪ {$P$}先生……\n今天就由杏奈来好好照顾你……哦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
